# Never upload secrets or build output. The hosted demo is read-only and needs no keys.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Not needed by the web UI (contracts, submodules, Foundry output, local artefacts). Anchored to the
# repo root: an unanchored `lib/` would also drop web/lib.
/lib/
/out/
/cache/
/broadcast/
/contracts/
/evidence/
/project-type/
/deployments/fork*.json
node_modules/
/web/.next/
/.vercel/
